# OPIc Question - Day16

## Question

**Tell me about a time when something turned out differently from what you expected.**

---

## Speaking Mission

Speak for **60–90 seconds**.

Include:

* What you expected
* What actually happened
* Why it was different
* How you felt
* What you learned from the experience

---

## Challenge

Try to use:

> I thought...

> But it turned out that...

> In the end,...

---

## Goal

오늘은 단순한 경험 설명이 아니라

**예상과 실제 결과를 비교해서 이야기하는 것**이 목표다.
